# Frontend Configuration Notes
# This is a static frontend project with NO build step and NO server runtime.
# Consequently, process.env variables are NOT read by browser JavaScript.

# Backend API Configuration:
# To configure the backend API URL, edit `js/config.js` or set the meta tag in `index.html`:
#
# Option 1 (Recommended): In `js/config.js`:
#   DEFAULT_API_BASE: 'https://your-portfolio-backend.vercel.app'
#
# Option 2: In `index.html` <head>:
#   <meta name="portfolio-api-base" content="https://your-portfolio-backend.vercel.app" />
#
# Option 3 (Local Development):
#   Defaults to 'http://localhost:3001' which matches the portfolio-backend dev server.
#
# Option 4 (Same-Origin / Reverse Proxy):
#   Set API_BASE to '' (empty string) to make relative calls to '/api/*' on the same host.
